{"source": "tally", "name": "props_2026-10_eip155_1_0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b_p001", "collected_at": "2026-10-05T06:19:47.311082+00:00", "request": {"method": "POST", "url": "https://api.tally.xyz/query", "params": null, "body": {"query": "\nquery Props($input: ProposalsInput!) {\n  proposals(input: $input) {\n    nodes { ... on Proposal {\n      id onchainId status quorum createdAt chainId\n      governor { id }\n      start { ... on Block { number timestamp } ... on BlocklessTimestamp { timestamp } }\n      end { ... on Block { number timestamp } ... on BlocklessTimestamp { timestamp } }\n      voteStats { type votesCount votersCount percent }\n      events { type createdAt }\n      metadata { title description }\n    } }\n    pageInfo { lastCursor }\n  }\n}", "variables": {"input": {"filters": {"governorId": "eip155:1:0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b", "includeArchived": true}, "sort": {"sortBy": "id", "isDescending": true}, "page": {"limit": 20, "afterCursor": "0;2360326837684405279"}}}}}, "response": {"data": {"proposals": {"nodes": [{"id": "2358996068886120119", "onchainId": "21", "status": "canceled", "quorum": "400000000000000000000000", "createdAt": "2024-06-26T19:04:05.422803Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b"}, "start": {"number": 20177828, "timestamp": "2024-06-30T19:36:59Z"}, "end": {"number": 20195108, "timestamp": "2024-07-03T05:12:59Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "104053633277734406383830", "votersCount": 1, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "drafted", "createdAt": "2024-06-26T19:04:05.426647Z"}, {"type": "created", "createdAt": "2024-06-26T19:05:34.737848Z"}, {"type": "activated", "createdAt": "2024-06-26T19:10:01.817052Z"}, {"type": "canceled", "createdAt": "2024-06-26T19:57:02.983684Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "# Transfer assets for CTX liquidity to the Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO", "description": "# Transfer assets for CTX liquidity to the Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO\nDear Cryptex DAO members,\n\n\n\nAs mentioned in the previous proposal ([https://www.tally.xyz/gov/cryptex/proposal/19](https://www.tally.xyz/gov/cryptex/proposal/19 \"https://www.tally.xyz/gov/cryptex/proposal/19\")), we will now proceed with the second on-chain vote regarding liquidity management.&#x20;\n\n\n\nDue to recent developments, the DAO has received USDC from market makers who have exercised their options. This influx of funds enables the DAO to proceed with the establishment of the CTX trading pool without the need for programmatically selling CTX for USDC as initially planned.&#x20;\n\n\n\nTo expand CTX liquidity on decentralized exchanges, the Cryptex DAO will allocate **50'000 CTX** and **150,000 USDC** from the **Cryptex DAO Treasury**. This amount will be transferred to the **Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO**.&#x20;\n\n\n\nThe Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO is a decentralized autonomous organization within the Cryptex ecosystem that manages liquidity provision for the protocol. It operates independently from the core development team and is governed by a multisig wallet managed by community members. The SubDAO's primary role is to make decisions related to liquidity allocation, token pairings, and adjustments, ensuring the protocol remains decentralized and responsive to the needs of its users.&#x20;\n\n\n\nWe invite all members of the Cryptex community to vote on this proposal to start the transfer. Your participation is crucial in shaping the future of our protocol and ensuring its continued growth and success."}}, {"id": "2348846702401685253", "onchainId": "20", "status": "executed", "quorum": "400000000000000000000000", "createdAt": "2024-06-12T18:59:06.655683Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b"}, "start": {"number": 20077682, "timestamp": "2024-06-16T21:47:47Z"}, "end": {"number": 20094962, "timestamp": "2024-06-19T07:23:47Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "556710014570062649942791", "votersCount": 6, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "created", "createdAt": "2024-06-12T18:59:06.661714Z"}, {"type": "activated", "createdAt": "2024-06-12T19:00:01.765783Z"}, {"type": "succeeded", "createdAt": "2024-06-15T05:00:03.632929Z"}, {"type": "queued", "createdAt": "2024-06-15T05:01:53.091553Z"}, {"type": "executed", "createdAt": "2024-06-18T12:49:59.051058Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "CIP-29: Renew Wintermute Trading/SkyNet Trading", "description": "CIP-29: Renew Wintermute Trading/SkyNet Trading"}}, {"id": "2335395383112369195", "onchainId": "19", "status": "executed", "quorum": "400000000000000000000000", "createdAt": "2024-05-25T05:33:44.438857Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b"}, "start": {"number": 19944840, "timestamp": "2024-05-29T10:59:23Z"}, "end": {"number": 19962120, "timestamp": "2024-05-31T20:35:23Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "572008856972415333386201", "votersCount": 6, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "drafted", "createdAt": "2024-05-25T05:33:44.44277Z"}, {"type": "created", "createdAt": "2024-05-25T05:37:41.037146Z"}, {"type": "activated", "createdAt": "2024-05-25T05:40:01.679296Z"}, {"type": "succeeded", "createdAt": "2024-05-27T15:35:01.628577Z"}, {"type": "queued", "createdAt": "2024-05-27T15:49:45.988534Z"}, {"type": "executed", "createdAt": "2024-05-30T22:15:26.592298Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "# Transfer assets for TCAP liquidity to the Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO", "description": "# Transfer assets for TCAP liquidity to the Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO\nDear Community Members,\n\nThe snapshot vote to select candidates for the SubDAO multisig has concluded. Based on the results, 0xDonnie, dnkta, and ClownBaby received approximately 70% of the votes.\n\nThe SubDAO multisig will begin with 3 signers, and on a quarterly, bi-annual, or annual basis, we can vote on adding more contributors to the SubDAO.\n\nThe multisig has been created and is ready to use, see below:\n\nETH: <https://etherscan.io/address/0x41187c70eB8eeEfDaEd4ED0bFF20005C53c3a7DD>\n\nBase: <https://basescan.org/address/0x41187c70eB8eeEfDaEd4ED0bFF20005C53c3a7DD>\n\nArbitrum: <https://arbiscan.io/address/0x41187c70eB8eeEfDaEd4ED0bFF20005C53c3a7DD>\n\n##\n\nNow, we are ready for an on-chain vote to move the assets approved for management from the previous proposals.\n\nWith this proposal, we will focus on transferring **69,206.38148 USDC** from the **Cryptex DAO Treasury** to the **Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO**.\n\nThe transferred USDC will be used to add liquidity for TCAP as voted by the community:\n\n<https://snapshot.org/#/cryptexdao.eth/proposal/0x2327d7e847060ffb043a00b49d5e997992ebd83994acbd969ec27e144144f6e1>\n\n###\n\nAfter this proposal, we will proceed with a second on-chain vote by the end of June to manage the CTX transfers for the CTX pool on Base.\n\nYour participation in these on-chain votes is crucial for the continued success and growth of our DAO. Please review the information provided and cast your vote. Your support and dedication are greatly appreciated.\n\nThank you for your ongoing commitment to our DAO"}}, {"id": "2335032237755467172", "onchainId": "18", "status": "canceled", "quorum": "400000000000000000000000", "createdAt": "2024-05-24T17:32:14.140037Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b"}, "start": {"number": 19941252, "timestamp": "2024-05-28T23:01:47Z"}, "end": {"number": 19958532, "timestamp": "2024-05-31T08:37:47Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "drafted", "createdAt": "2024-05-24T17:32:14.142511Z"}, {"type": "created", "createdAt": "2024-05-24T17:33:50.879865Z"}, {"type": "activated", "createdAt": "2024-05-24T17:35:01.628651Z"}, {"type": "canceled", "createdAt": "2024-05-24T20:41:20.860903Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "# Transfer assets for TCAP liquidity to the Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO", "description": "# Transfer assets for TCAP liquidity to the Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO\nDear Community Members,\n\n\n\nThe snapshot vote to select candidates for the SubDAO multisig has concluded. Based on the results, 0xDonnie, dnkta, and ClownBaby received approximately 70% of the votes.\n\nThe SubDAO multisig will begin with 3 signers, and on a quarterly, bi-annual, or annual basis, we can vote on adding more contributors to the SubDAO.\n\nThe multisig has been created and is ready to use, see below:\n\n<https://etherscan.io/address/0x41187c70eB8eeEfDaEd4ED0bFF20005C53c3a7DD>\n\n##\n\nNow, we are ready for an on-chain vote to move the assets approved for management from the previous proposals.&#x20;\n\nWith this proposal, we will focus on transferring **69,206.38148 USDC** from the **Cryptex DAO Treasury** to the **Cryptex Liquidity Management SubDAO**.\n\nThe transferred USDC will be used to add liquidity for TCAP as voted by the community:\n\n<https://snapshot.org/#/cryptexdao.eth/proposal/0x2327d7e847060ffb043a00b49d5e997992ebd83994acbd969ec27e144144f6e1>\n\n###\n\nAfter this proposal, we will proceed with a second on-chain vote by the end of June to manage the CTX transfers for the CTX pool on Base.&#x20;\n\n\n\nYour participation in these on-chain votes is crucial for the continued success and growth of our DAO. Please review the information provided and cast your vote. Your support and dedication are greatly appreciated.\n\n\n\nThank you for your ongoing commitment to our DAO"}}, {"id": "2292214648008607238", "onchainId": "17", "status": "executed", "quorum": null, "createdAt": "2024-03-26T15:41:19.687187Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0x874C5D592AfC6803c3DD60d6442357879F196d5b"}, "start": {"number": 19519555, "timestamp": "2024-03-31T09:22:23Z"}, "end": {"number": 19536835, "timestamp": "2024-04-02T18:58:23Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "465576838983601356866765", "votersCount": 3, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "ev